    "excerpt": "Example Usage <Tabs> <Tab title=\"Node\"> ```ts // Retrieve app information const info = await Liatir.desktop.app.info(); console.log('Platform:', info.os); ``` </Tab> <Tab title=\"Python\"> ```python # Retrieve app information info = ctx.liatir.desktop.app.info(…",
