    "locator": "Docs / Tools / Seqkit / Running seqkit stats",
    "excerpt": "Running seqkit stats 1. Navigate to **Tools → seqkit**. 2. Select a FASTA or FASTQ file from your Data library. 3. Optionally enable **extended stats** to include N50, Q20, Q30, and GC content (adds a small overhead for large files). 4. Click **Run stats**.",
